			"hadithnumber": 4611,
			"arabicnumber": 4611,
			"text": "It was narrated from'Amr bin Shu'aib, from his father that his grandfather, Said:that the Messenger of Allah said: \"It is not permissible to lend on the condition of a sale, or to have two conditions in one transaction, or to sell what you do not have.\" (Sahih)",
